			"Date": "2026-06-12T16:40:16Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				2
			],
			"Message": "style(Mist): Add header badge table to Architecture.md and refine intro text\n\nReplace the plain markdown heading in Architecture.md with an HTML header badge table containing the Land logo (with dark/light mode support) and centered title, matching the README convention established across other CodeEditorLand components. Add a horizontal rule separator beneath the header to visually distinguish branding from content.\n\nRephrase the Architecture.md opening from a document-introductory framing (\"This document describes…\") to a direct declarative statement about Mist's role, and apply the same pattern to DeepDive.md by removing the self-referential \"This document provides…\" lead-in in favour of a concise subject-first sentence.\n\nNo functional changes — presentation and consistency only.",
			"SHA": "c86471ac9205b3e01f7620aad9bebc72993bdcbb"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T16:22:27Z",
